  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Port\u2019 Ercole</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Portus Herculis is located on the eastern side of the Monte Argentario peninsula, about 40 km south-east of Grosseto and about 7 km south-west of Orbetello. and about 12 km from Porto Santo Stefano. The site was in use as a port during the Etruscan, Roman, and Late Antique phases of occupation. It is included on the Peutinger map and in the Itinerarium Maritimum.",
